<h1>Welcome to SS Hall</h1>
<p>Dear <%= @user.name %>,</p>
<p>
  An account has been created for you on the SS Hall hostel management system, where you can see your room,
  your tenancy dates and how to pay rent.
</p>
<p>
  <strong><%= link_to "Set your password", @setup_url %></strong> to get started.
  This link works for <%= User::ACCOUNT_SETUP_LINK_VALIDITY.inspect %>. If it expires, use “Forgot password?” on the
  <%= link_to "login page", root_url %> with this email address (<%= @user.email_address %>).
</p>
<p>If you have any questions, please reach out to the hostel management team.</p>
<p>We wish you a pleasant stay at the hostel.</p>
<%= render "signature" %>
